      h3("Every Day"),
      bullet("Check and approve or decline all pending member requests"),
      bullet("Review all posts in the approval queue. Approve relevant posts, decline spam"),
      bullet("Respond to any comments or questions from members with a brief acknowledgment if needed"),
      bullet("Flag any problematic posts or members for Bethany before taking action"),
      spacer(),
      h3("Every Week"),
      bullet("Post one piece of content to keep the group active (question prompt, industry stat, quick tip)"),
      bullet("Check for any rule violations and remove offending posts"),
      bullet("Send Bethany a brief weekly summary: new member count, top post of the week, any issues"),
      spacer(),
      h3("Member Approval Criteria"),
      body("Approve if:"),
      bullet("They answered all three questions"),
      bullet("They identify as an owner, partner, or operator"),
      bullet("Their profile looks real (has a photo, posts, connections)"),
      spacer(),
      body("Decline if:"),
      bullet("They skipped the questions"),
      bullet("They identify as a vendor, student, or unrelated professional"),
      bullet("Their profile looks fake or brand new with no activity"),
      spacer(),

      // STEP 6
      sectionTag("STEP 6"),
      h3("Meta Compliance Requirements"),
      body("Meta requires all groups to follow their Community Standards and Group Rules policies. Here is what you need to stay compliant:"),
      spacer(),
      bullet("Published group rules must be added and visible to members. Complete Step 2 above."),
      bullet("Do not allow posts that contain misleading health claims, fake medical advice, or before/after photos that violate health advertising policies."),
      bullet("Do not allow any post that promotes illegal services or violates HIPAA by sharing identifiable patient information."),
      bullet("Do not allow spam, coordinated inauthentic behavior, or posts that link to low-quality external sites."),
      bullet("Regularly remove inactive or fake accounts. You can do this by going to Members and filtering by Last Active."),
      bullet("If Meta flags a post for review, take action within 24 hours. Delaying can result in admin restrictions."),
      spacer(),
      note("Meta can restrict group creation or activity if your group generates repeated violations. Consistent moderation protects the group and your accounts."),
      spacer(),

      // PINNED POST
      sectionTag("STEP 7"),
      h3("First Pinned Post"),
      body("After the group is created and Bethany is admin, post this as the first piece of content and pin it to the top of the group. Post it from the Luxora account or from your own, then pin it."),
      spacer(),
      highlight("Welcome to [Group Name]. We built this community for one reason: medspa owners deserve a space where they can ask the hard questions and get real answers from people who actually understand this business."),
      spacer(),
      highlight("No fluff. No gatekeeping. No sales pitches."),
      spacer(),
      highlight("This is a peer community for owners, operators, and practice leaders in the aesthetics space. Drop in with your questions, share what is working, and connect with people who are building what you are building."),
      spacer(),
      highlight("To get us started: tell us your name, your medspa, and the one thing you wish someone had told you when you were starting out."),
