    hashtags: "#MedSpaOwner #ClientExperience #LuxoraCollective"
  },
  {
    week: 11, category: "Peer Learning",
    text: `What's one tool, software, or system your practice genuinely could not function without right now?

Not a concept. The actual thing. The one that if it disappeared tomorrow you'd feel it immediately.

Drop the name and one line on what changed when you started using it.`,
    hashtags: "#MedSpaOwner #MedSpaOperations #LuxoraCollective"
  },
  {
    week: 12, category: "Mindset",
    text: `If your practice was running at what it's actually capable of, not what it's doing right now but what it could do with the right things in place, what looks different?

Not just the revenue. Your time. Your energy on a Monday morning. Whether you feel like you're building something or just keeping up.

Where's the gap biggest for you? When did you last really look at it honestly?`,
    hashtags: "#MedSpaOwner #GrowthMindset #LuxoraCollective"
  },
  {
    week: 13, category: "Peer Learning",
    text: `What's the most impactful hire you've ever made in your practice?

And how long did you wait before you finally pulled the trigger?

Because so many of us know what the right hire would change. We can feel the gap every single week. And then we talk ourselves out of it for months.

If you're sitting on a hiring decision right now, tell us what the hesitation actually is. Someone in here has been in that exact spot.`,
    hashtags: "#MedSpaOwner #MedSpaTeam #LuxoraCollective"
  },
  {
    week: 14, category: "Operations",
    text: `What have you had to let go of in order to grow?

A standard you were carrying personally because no one else would hold it the same way. A task you knew needed to be delegated but couldn't quite release. A way of doing things that worked when it was just you but quietly became the thing holding you back.

How long did you hold on before you finally let it go?

And what did holding on that long actually cost you?`,
    hashtags: "#MedSpaOwner #Delegation #LuxoraCollective"
